Variable rec : mstate -> Z -> Z -> (mstate -> Z -> M R) -> M R -> M R.
Hypothesis HREC : forall st j req k bail, cinit st = 1 -> req <= LRQ n -> KOK st k -> TOK st (rec st j req k bail).

